														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2222522">
									

<p>No series makes me respond quite like Solidarity.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>ten million meaningless particulars</p>
</blockquote>
<p>'Sargasso' kinda doesn't work with it, but nevertheless I really like this line.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>[Momoko: Can we call this ‘Operation: Fuck the Moon?’]</p>
<p>[Momoko: ‘Cause I’m calling it ‘Fuck the Moon’.]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This method of conversation remains the best part of these stories. Moon-fucking first!</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Space warfare is, unfortunately, ninety percent calculus, and only ten percent exploding spaceships.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>My kind of narrator.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>I’m the goddamn Space Wizard!</p>
</blockquote>
<p>He <em>is</em> the Juggernaught, bitch.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Is this the kind of teleportation where it kills you and makes a copy?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I love that he had to check and be sure.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>[Momoko: Oh my God, we killed physics.]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Best line.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>HOLY SHIT</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I love it.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>the first four seconds of Lucky Star</p>
</blockquote>
<p>AI WAN SUMPIECE</p>
<blockquote>
<p>What up shitheads</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Immediately I know this is being posted on 4chan.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Fuck-You-Einstein</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Oh my god are you fucking kidding me.</p>
<p>Just, fuck and yes. So anime, so OTT, so perfectly, unutterably <em>amazing</em>.</p>

							</div>

								
					
